            "source:4ee51d9ccbef2e7871b6937e"
          ],
          "text": "A Coilfang door-control device in Coilfang Reservoir. Using its access panel is accompanied by a faint echo; when the main door opens, a loud rumble of metal grinding on stone is heard.",
