            "source:58bb54a8b6e0f9af6b8073fd"
          ],
          "text": "A giant with a combat-focused presence, the Bog Overlord uses Fungal Decay while out of combat, then attacks with Poison Bolt and Trample. When badly wounded, it enrages and gives an angry battle shout.",
